{"id":"common","duration":63.11,"voice":"Juniper","segments":[{"t":0,"cap":"Choose the chart from the question you are answering."},{"t":2.77,"cap":"To compare categories, use bars. For change over time, a line. For part of a whole, sorted bars of each part's share."},{"t":13.86,"cap":"Pies show values by angle and area, which people compare poorly. In Pie on Trial, the same values were easier to rank as bars."},{"t":24.58,"cap":"Stacked bars have a catch. Only the bottom segment and the total sit on the baseline."},{"t":31.38,"cap":"Every middle segment floats, so comparing it across years means subtracting by eye."},{"t":37.23,"cap":"Instead, show two charts side by side, one for the total and one for the categories, or use a paneled bar chart, with one panel per category."},{"t":47.77,"cap":"And a bar chart should not show averages. A bar suggests that the data sit inside it, and it hides how spread out they are. Show the points instead, with a line at each average, or on top of a box plot."}],"items":[{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":0.25,"x":44,"y":30,"h":54,"text":"Start from the question","d":0.81,"big":true,"color":"red"},{"k":"sketch","page":0,"t":2.77,"name":"chooseChart","box":{"x":60,"y":100,"w":840,"h":414},"phases":[6.05,9.1]},{"k":"page","page":1,"t":13.86},{"k":"hand","page":1,"t":13.86,"x":44,"y":30,"h":54,"text":"Pies: angle and area are hard to compare","d":1.4,"big":true,"color":"red"},{"k":"sketch","page":1,"t":13.86,"name":"pieVsBars","box":{"x":60,"y":100,"w":840,"h":414},"phases":[19.5]},{"k":"page","page":2,"t":24.58},{"k":"hand","page":2,"t":24.83,"x":44,"y":30,"h":54,"text":"Stacked bars","d":0.5,"big":true,"color":"red"},{"k":"hand","page":2,"t":27.13,"x":44,"y":84,"h":44,"text":"only the bottom segment","d":0.81},{"k":"hand","page":2,"t":28.63,"x":78,"y":128,"h":44,"text":"and the total sit on","d":0.7},{"k":"hand","page":2,"t":29.71,"x":78,"y":172,"h":44,"text":"the baseline","d":0.5},{"k":"sketch","page":2,"t":24.58,"name":"stacked","box":{"x":500,"y":96,"w":430,"h":414},"phases":[31.38]},{"k":"hand","page":2,"t":31.38,"x":44,"y":232,"h":44,"text":"middle segments float:","d":0.77},{"k":"hand","page":2,"t":35.17,"x":78,"y":276,"h":44,"text":"you subtract by eye","d":0.67},{"k":"page","page":3,"t":37.23},{"k":"hand","page":3,"t":37.48,"x":44,"y":30,"h":54,"text":"Instead of stacking","d":0.67,"big":true,"color":"red"},{"k":"sketch","page":3,"t":37.23,"name":"unstacked","box":{"x":60,"y":100,"w":840,"h":414},"phases":[40.46,41.59,42.98]},{"k":"page","page":4,"t":47.77},{"k":"hand","page":4,"t":48.02,"x":44,"y":30,"h":54,"text":"No bars for averages","d":0.7,"big":true,"color":"red"},{"k":"hand","page":4,"t":51.25,"x":44,"y":84,"h":44,"text":"a bar suggests the data","d":0.81},{"k":"hand","page":4,"t":53.2,"x":78,"y":128,"h":44,"text":"sit inside it","d":0.5},{"k":"hand","page":4,"t":55.04,"x":44,"y":172,"h":44,"text":"and it hides the spread","d":0.81},{"k":"hand","page":4,"t":57.8,"x":44,"y":232,"h":44,"text":"show the points:","d":0.56,"color":"blue"},{"k":"hand","page":4,"t":59.39,"x":78,"y":276,"h":44,"text":"+ a line at the average","d":0.81,"color":"blue"},{"k":"hand","page":4,"t":61.08,"x":78,"y":320,"h":44,"text":"or on a box plot","d":0.56,"color":"blue"},{"k":"sketch","page":4,"t":48.82,"name":"meanBar","box":{"x":500,"y":96,"w":430,"h":414},"phases":[57.8,61.08]}]}